## FILE RULES

- **One scenario file per module**
- Filename: `<module-id>.md` inside `scenarios/app/`
- Cover **ALL** user-facing operations in that module that exist in code:
  list, view, create, update, draft save/resume, submit, delete draft, punch-in/out, export/share, settings links, etc.
- **Overwrite** if the file already exists
- Prefer **Module IDs** that match `docs/business-rules/` filenames when applicable (e.g. `dealer`, `distributor`, `farmer-part-1`, `attendance`)
- Mobile-only areas without a matching business-rule file still get a clear kebab-case module-id (document it in prompts)

